# Stone Hill edit home (critical)

www.shmspto.org deploys from **`auraflux-dev/shmspto`** only (git push → treasurer auto-deploy).

## Where to edit

| Surface | Edit in |
|---------|---------|
| Stone Hill visitor, portal, staff, shared product | **`~/shmspto`** (`auraflux-dev/shmspto`) |
| Pavilion demo / trial / marketing | **`pavilion`** (this repo) — Pavilion-only layers |

**Shared product is authored in `~/shmspto`, not here.** Do not implement Staff / portal / checkout in `pavilion/frontend` and plan to port later.

For Stone Hill work, prefer the **`shmspto` Cursor workspace** (`move_agent_to_root` → `~/shmspto`).

## Pavilion consumes on request

Pavilion catches up **only when Rob asks**:

```bash
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --dry-run
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --apply
```

Do **not** run sync or deploy Pavilion after a SHMS ship unless Rob requested it.

**Do not** use `--to-shms` unless Rob explicitly asks (rare).

Pushing `pavilion` `main` does **not** update www.

## After a Stone Hill application ship (in ~/shmspto)

1. Commit/push **`~/shmspto`**
2. `node scripts/check-prod-deploy.mjs` (from shmspto)
3. **Stop.** Do not sync or deploy Pavilion unless Rob asks.

## Anti-patterns (forbidden)

- `vercel link` / `vercel deploy` Stone Hill from this monorepo
- Treating pavilion `frontend/` edits as live Stone Hill product
- Auto `--from-shms` or Pavilion deploy after every school ship
- `--to-shms` as the default product workflow
